{"version":1,"content":"\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261023%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9C%E8%94%A1%E5%A4%A9%E9%B3%B3%E6%A1%88%EF%BD%9C%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E4%BB%8A%E8%99%95%E7%90%86%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E7%88%AD%E8%AD%B0-%E9%99%AA%E5%AF%A9%E5%9C%98%E9%81%BF%E5%B8%AD-%E5%82%B3%E5%AA%92%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%AF%E5%A0%B1%E9%81%93%E6%9C%89%E9%97%9C%E8%81%86%E8%A8%8A%E5%85%A7%E5%AE%B9-819x1024.png\" width=\"819\"/></figure>\n<p><strong>蔡天鳳遇害案，蔡前夫鄺港智、前家翁鄺球及前大伯鄺港傑否認謀殺罪。案件今（23日）續審，為聆訊的第22天，惟是日須在陪審團避席下處理法律爭議，傳媒不可報道陪審團避席時的聆訊內容。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>聆訊至下午4時半散庭，下周一續處理法律爭議。【<a href=\"https://bit.ly/4APGPhR\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案報道結集</a>】</strong></p>\n<p>\n<p><a href=\"https://linktr.ee/hkcourtnews\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">訂閱《庭刊》</a></p>\n</p>\n<p>控方昨日傳召控方專家證人、政府化驗所高級化驗師譚卓寧出庭，譚尚未完成證供，料將續作供。</p>\n<p>3名被告分別為鄺港智、鄺港傑及鄺球，被控一項謀殺罪，即於2023年2月21日，在香港謀殺女子蔡天鳳。鄺港智、鄺港傑承認阻止合法埋葬屍體罪，控罪指他們於2023年2月21日至2月23日之間，在香港大埔汀角路龍尾村56B號地下內阻止合法埋葬蔡天鳳的屍體，鄺球則否認此罪。<strong>【<a href=\"https://bit.ly/4APGPhR\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案報道結集</a>】</strong></p>\n<p>法院：高等法院<br/>法官：暫委法官祁彥輝<br/>被告：鄺港智、鄺港傑、鄺球<br/>控罪：謀殺、阻止合法埋葬屍體<br/><br/><strong>法律代表：</strong><br/>控方：外聘資深大律師Charlotte Draycott郭莎樂、高級助理刑事檢控專員梁育珩、高級檢控官林曉敏、檢控官尹培軒<br/>鄺港傑：大律師Trevor Beel<br/>鄺球：大律師Oliver Davies戴偉奧<br/>鄺港智：大律師Andrew Raffell安華暉<br/>案件編號：HCCC198/2025</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://qr.payme.hsbc.com.hk/2/QrndvPxDgEi2MhNiNPz4b8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"916\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9CHKCourtNews_PayMe_QR_code.png\" width=\"716\"/></a></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/hkcourtnews_Octopus_QRcode_Payment_v4.png\" width=\"1080\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<p><strong>如欲接收每日報道整合，請在訊息欄內填寫電郵地址</strong></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T09:44:45.310171+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":546,"images":3,"source":"法庭線","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T06:12:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T08:58:20.000929+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T09:38:44.277711+00:00","content_hash":"f5701ea52c523245a83127f2439e27536f355283baf4270c4262718f70fa3d9a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 520","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}